WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.520
I listened to music on YouTube Music,

2
00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:05.000
but ads kept popping up all the time.

3
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.510
And often, if I liked a song, I liked to hear it slow,

4
00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:12.480
fast, ultra slow, or ultra fast.

5
00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:16.780
And many other times I only wanted the 30 seconds in the

6
00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:21.180
middle, the first 20 seconds, or the best part at the

7
00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:22.570
end of the song.

8
00:00:22.570 --> 00:00:27.658
And of course, I played it again and again and again.
